---
import cameras from '../data/cameras.json';import samples from '../data/samples.json';
import Layout from './Layout.astro';import Comparison from './Comparison.astro';import Calculator from './Calculator.astro';
---
<Layout home={true} locale={Astro.props.locale || 'en'}><section class="hero wrap tool-intro"><h1>RAW vs JPEG: Compare Photos Side by Side</h1><p>Drag the slider to explore real camera samples. No upload or signup needed.</p></section><Comparison/><section class="wrap decision"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE QUICK DECISION</p><h2>Choose for the way you shoot.</h2></div><article><span class="format-tag">RAW</span><h3>Room to work.</h3><p>Keep sensor data for flexible editing. Useful when lighting is tricky, the shot matters, or you want control over the final look.</p></article><article><span class="format-tag">JPEG</span><h3>Ready to go.</h3><p>Smaller files with a finished look. Useful for fast sharing, simple workflows, and photographs you don’t plan to edit extensively.</p></article><article><span class="format-tag">RAW + JPEG</span><h3>A little of both.</h3><p>A ready-to-share image and an editable original. Convenient, with extra storage and more files to manage.</p></article></section><Calculator/><section id="camera-guides" class="wrap guides"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / CAMERA FIELD NOTES</p><h2>Start with your camera.</h2><p>Three measured samples. A dedicated guide for each camera.</p></div><div class="camera-guide-grid">{cameras.map(camera=><a class="guide-card" href={`/${samples.find(s=>s.id===camera.sampleId)!.slug}-raw-vs-jpeg/`}><span class="eyebrow">{samples.find(s=>s.id===camera.sampleId)!.brand.toUpperCase()}</span><h3>{camera.shortName}</h3><p>{camera.modeLabel}</p><p>{(samples.find(s=>s.id===camera.sampleId)!.rawBytes/1e6).toFixed(2)} MB · one measured RAW file</p><span class="guide-arrow">View sample & storage guide ↗</span></a>)}</div></section></Layout>
